{"id":"e84e0f0a140f460e","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-promptly-simple.md","title":"Promptly simple：固定枚举的快速击中","display":"df-promptly-simple — Promptly simple：固定枚举的快速击中","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-promptly-simple","aliases":["20-df-promptly-simple"],"display":"df-promptly-simple — Promptly simple：固定枚举的快速击中","chapter":"supplement","section":"supplement.ce-lattice","source_kind":"legacy-supplement","verification_status":"definition-source-pending","source_reference":"旧条目的签名与阶段边界修复；并非 Soare 2016 第 15 章陈述","depends_on":["[[20-df-simple]]","[[20-df-stages]]","[[20-df-computable]]","[[20-df-finite-code]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-promptly-simple"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-promptly-simple</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-promptly-simple — Promptly simple：固定枚举的快速击中"},{"key":"chapter","html":"supplement"},{"key":"section","html":"supplement.ce-lattice"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"legacy-supplement"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-source-pending"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"旧条目的签名与阶段边界修复；并非 Soare 2016 第 15 章陈述"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"428fc565e7338639\" href=\"?note=428fc565e7338639\" title=\"20-df-simple\">20-df-simple</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"59004ac6d23e86f8\" href=\"?note=59004ac6d23e86f8\" title=\"20-df-finite-code\">20-df-finite-code</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal E\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal E\\)</span>；固定可计算增长有限枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_s)\">\\((A_s)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_0=\\varnothing\">\\(A_0=\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\bigcup_sA_s\">\\(A=\\bigcup_sA_s\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"428fc565e7338639\" href=\"?note=428fc565e7338639\" title=\"20-df-simple\">20-df-simple</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>。</p>\n<p>上标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tot}\">\\(\\mathrm{tot}\\)</span> 表示全定义限制：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\\)</span>；相对族采用同一限制。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"59004ac6d23e86f8\" href=\"?note=59004ac6d23e86f8\" title=\"20-df-finite-code\">20-df-finite-code</a>。</p>\n<aside class=\"callout\" data-kind=\"todo\"><div class=\"callout-title\">核验边界</div><p>本条状态为 definition-source-pending；正文给出修订后的定义或命题草案，尚缺完整来源核对或独立证明。不可仅凭文件类型将其作为已认证定理使用。</p>\n</aside>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}promptly\\text{-}simple}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{PromptlySimple}(A,(A_s))\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Simple}(A)\\land\\exists p\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\\n[(\\forall s\\ p(s)\\ge s)\\land\n\\forall e\\ (|W_e|=\\omega\\Rightarrow\\exists s\\ \\exists x\\\n(x\\in W_{e,s+1}\\setminus W_{e,s}\\land x\\in A_{p(s+1)}))],\\\\\n\\operatorname{PromptlySimple}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists a\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\\n[D_{a(0)}=\\varnothing\\land\\forall s\\ D_{a(s)}\\subseteq D_{a(s+1)}\n\\land A=\\bigcup_sD_{a(s)}\\land\n\\operatorname{PromptlySimple}(A,(D_{a(s)})_{s\\in\\omega})].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}promptly\\text{-}simple}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{PromptlySimple}(A,(A_s))\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Simple}(A)\\land\\exists p\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\\n[(\\forall s\\ p(s)\\ge s)\\land\n\\forall e\\ (|W_e|=\\omega\\Rightarrow\\exists s\\ \\exists x\\\n(x\\in W_{e,s+1}\\setminus W_{e,s}\\land x\\in A_{p(s+1)}))],\\\\\n\\operatorname{PromptlySimple}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists a\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\\n[D_{a(0)}=\\varnothing\\land\\forall s\\ D_{a(s)}\\subseteq D_{a(s+1)}\n\\land A=\\bigcup_sD_{a(s)}\\land\n\\operatorname{PromptlySimple}(A,(D_{a(s)})_{s\\in\\omega})].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>一参数谓词在断言中正式量化可计算有限枚举，不只在 Remark 中口头省略第二参数；下游 promptly-nonrec 采用该签名。响应界可取非递减并大于当前阶段。必须对“刚进入 W_e 的成员”计时，不能用早已出现的一个成员在任意晚阶段击中来代替。旧稿 s−1 在 s=0 未定义，已改为 s+1。此处规范化既有书外概念，原始文献追溯待补。</p>\n<p>来源：旧条目的签名与阶段边界修复；并非 Soare 2016 第 15 章陈述。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-simple","status":"resolved","id":"428fc565e7338639","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-simple]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","