ghtarrow\\exists s\\ \\exists x\\\n(x\\in W_{e,s+1}\\setminus W_{e,s}\\land x\\in A_{p(s+1)}))],\\\\\n\\operatorname{PromptlySimple}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists a\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\\n[D_{a(0)}=\\varnothing\\land\\forall s\\ D_{a(s)}\\subseteq D_{a(s+1)}\n\\land A=\\bigcup_sD_{a(s)}\\land\n\\operatorname{PromptlySimple}(A,(D_{a(s)})_{s\\in\\omega})].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":2508,"backlinks":[{"id":"48e0f1ed97a0b67b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-promptly-simple]]；see [[20-thm-simple-properties]]；see [[20-df-redeg]]。"}],"outgoing":["428fc565e7338639","4ef1aee16db6b308","e343870c773cb68e","59004ac6d23e86f8"]}